# Sun Gulf Realty SEO Implementation Rules

## Overview
These rules define the SEO strategy and implementation patterns for Sun Gulf Realty's website using Next.js 15. Focus on Cape Coral/Southwest Florida real estate market with emphasis on local SEO, structured data, and conversion optimization.

## Target Market & Keywords
- **Primary Location**: Cape Coral, Fort Myers, Southwest Florida
- **Primary Keywords**: "Cape Coral real estate agent", "Cape Coral homes for sale", "Fort Myers realtor", "Southwest Florida real estate"
- **Long-tail Keywords**: "Cape Coral waterfront homes", "luxury homes Cape Coral", "investment properties Cape Coral"
- **Target Audiences**: Move-up buyers (55%), First-time buyers (20%), Florida relocators (10%), Investment buyers (15%)

## 1. Metadata Generation Patterns

### 1.1 Use generateSeoMetadata Function
Always use the existing `generateSeoMetadata` helper function with these parameters:

```typescript
export const metadata: Metadata = generateSeoMetadata({
  title: string, // 50-60 characters max
  description: string, // 150-160 characters max
  keywords: string[], // 5-10 relevant keywords
  canonicalUrl?: string, // Full canonical URL
  ogImage?: string, // 1200x630px image
  ogType?: "website" | "article" | "profile", // Default: website
  twitterCard?: "summary" | "summary_large_image", // Default: summary_large_image
  noIndex?: boolean, // Default: false
  additionalMeta?: Record<string, string> // Extra meta tags
});
```

### 1.2 Page-Specific Metadata Patterns

#### Homepage
```typescript
export const metadata: Metadata = generateSeoMetadata({
  title: "Sun Gulf Realty - Premier Cape Coral Real Estate Agent | Different by Design",
  description: "Experience real estate different by design with Sun Gulf Realty. Your trusted Cape Coral real estate experts specializing in waterfront homes, luxury properties, and investment opportunities.",
  keywords: [
    "Cape Coral real estate agent",
    "Fort Myers realtor", 
    "Southwest Florida real estate",
    "Cape Coral homes for sale",
    "waterfront properties Cape Coral"
